\",\"learningActivities\":\"Lecture, Discussion, In-class Exercise\",\"resources\":\"1\"}],\"assessmentCloMatrix\":{\"0\":{\"CLO1\":\"30.0\",\"CLO2\":\"30.0\",\"CLO3\":\"30.0\"},\"1\":{\"CLO1\":\"10.0\",\"CLO2\":\"30.0\",\"CLO3\":\"30.0\"}},\"readings\":[{\"title\":\"C How to Program 8th\",\"author\":\"Paul Deitel\",\"publisher\":\"44 / 517 45\",\"year\":\"2016\",\"usageType\":\"REQUIRED\"}],\"assessmentPassNote\":\"%Pass: Target that % of students having scores greater than 50 out of 100. 5.\",\"contentNote\":\"\"}','2026-09-07 03:21:48','2026-09-11 08:00:57','Learning the basics of programming','Compulsory','Semester 2','English','Compulsory (CS, NE, CE)','Lecture','195','45 (lecture) + 30 (laboratory) study hours)','120','None','This course concentrates on learning the basics of programming languages which are the foundations for further studies in IT. The course enables students to get familiar with C programming language. The course covers all basic C data structures, control flows, simple data structures as well as other advanced topics which include pointers, bit operators, file processing, dynamic data types. 43 / 517 44','Short-answer questions, Programming exercises','Attendance: A minimum attendance of 80 percent is compulsory for the class sessions. Students will be assessed on the basis of their class participation. Questions and comments are strongly encouraged. Assignments/Examination: Students must have more than 50/100 points overall to pass this course.',NULL,NULL,'IT116IU','C/C++ Programming',NULL,'CONFIRMED','Hồ sơ CTĐT Khóa 2026 - Khoa học máy tính - v7 - Tổng hợp.pdf','application/pdf','__AUDIT_RESET__3013','IMPORT_PDF',4),(3051,27,2,'v2.0','AUDIT2026','SUBMITTED',0,1,NULL,'2026-09-09 10:12:39',NULL,NULL,'{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"internalNotes\":\"\",\"personResponsible\":\"responsible Lecturers (thesis advisor)\",\"dateRevised\":\"2025-06-10\",\"creditPoints\":\"\",\"lectureCredits\":\"0\",\"laboratoryCredits\":\"10\",\"workloadStudentResponsibi