:10:24','name - (in English) LISTENING AE1 (Listening and Note-taking) - (in Vietnamese) Nghe AE1 (Nghe và Ghi chú) Course The course is designed to develop students’ academic listening and note- designation taking skills for effective participation in lecture-based learning in their major courses. It is built around lectures and authentic lecture-style listening texts from a range of academic fields, including business, science, education, and the social sciences. The course emphasizes listening comprehension, note-taking strategies, and the use of appropriate digital tools to prepare, organize, and revise notes and summaries.','Compulsory','Semester 2','English / Vietnamese','Compulsory','Lectures methods Individual practice Discussion Pair work Group work',NULL,NULL,NULL,'None',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"rubrics\":[{\"type\":\"\",\"title\":\"5.1. Rubrics for Listening e-Portfolio\",\"scaleLabels\":[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Level 4\"],\"criteria\":[]}]}',NULL,'EN008IU','Listening AE1',NULL,'CONFIRMED','Hồ sơ CTĐT Khóa 2026 - Khoa học máy tính - v7 - Tổng hợp.pdf','application/pdf','CS-2021','IMPORT_PDF',0),(3739,19,1,'v1.0','CS2026','DRAFT',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"internalNotes\":\"\",\"personResponsible\":\"Lecturers of School of\",\"dateRevised\":\"\",\"creditPoints\":\"\",\"lectureCredits\":\"\",\"laboratoryCredits\":\"\",\"workloadStudentResponsibility\":\"\",\"ploCodes\":[\"PLO1\",\"PLO2\",\"PLO3\",\"PLO4\",\"PLO5\",\"PLO6\"],\"cloPloMatrix\":{},\"topicDetails\":{\"0\":{\"clo\":\"\",\"assessments\":\"Quiz\",\"resources\":\"\",\"level\":\"I, T, U\",\"weight\":\"2\"},\"1\":{\"clo\":\"\",\"assessments\":\"Quiz\",\"resources\":\"\",\"level\":\"I, T, U\",\"weight\":\"2\"},\"2\":{\"clo\":\"\",\"assessments\":\"Quiz, Lab, Midterm examination\",\"resources\":\"\",\"level\":\"I, T, U\",\"weight\":\"1\"},\"3\":{\"clo\":\"\",\"assessments\":\"Quiz, Lab, Midterm examination\",\"resources\":\"\",\"level\":\"T, U\",\"weight\":\"1\"},\"4\":{\"cl