, U Binary tree 1 T, U Examination forms Short-answer questions, Programming exercises Study and Attendance: A minimum attendance of 80 percent is examination compulsory for the class sessions. Students will be assessed on requirements the basis of their class participation. Questions and comments are strongly encouraged. Assignments/Examination: Students must have more than 50/100 points overall to pass this course. Reading list 1. Paul Deitel, C How to Program 8th, 2016 45 2. Learning Outcomes Matrix The relationship between\",\"exam_forms\":\"Short-answer questions, Programming exercises\",\"exam_requirements\":\"Attendance: A minimum attendance of 80 percent is compulsory for the class sessions. Students will be assessed on the basis of their class participation. Questions and comments are strongly encouraged. Assignments/Examination: Students must have more than 50/100 points overall to pass this course.\",\"rubrics\":null,\"major\":null,\"course_code_snapshot\":\"IT116IU\",\"course_name_snapshot\":\"C/C++ Programming\",\"final_approval_date\":null,\"import_status\":\"CONFIRMED\",\"original_file_name\":\"Hồ sơ CTĐT Khóa 2026 - Khoa học máy tính - v7 - Tổng hợp.pdf\",\"original_file_type\":\"application/pdf\",\"program\":\"CS-2021\",\"source_type\":\"IMPORT_PDF\",\"lock_version\":2,\"semester_identity\":\"Semester 2\"},\"clo\":[{\"id\":9625,\"syllabus_id\":3695,\"code\":\"CLO1\",\"description\":\"Understand programming languages and applications, outcomes how applications work\",\"description_vn\":null,\"competency_level\":\"KNOWLEDGE\",\"bloom_level\":null,\"order_index\":1},{\"id\":9626,\"syllabus_id\":3695,\"code\":\"CLO2\",\"description\":\"Understand basic data structure and control flow of C programming language\",\"description_vn\":null,\"competency_level\":\"SKILL\",\"bloom_level\":null,\"order_index\":2},{\"id\":9627,\"syllabus_id\":3695,\"code\":\"CLO3\",\"description\":\"Able to write applications using C\",\"description_vn\":null,\"competency_level\"