, implement, and evaluate a computing-based solution to meet a given set of computing requirements in the context of the program???s discipline.\",\"description_vn\":null,\"category\":\"KNOWLEDGE\",\"version_number\":1,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-04T12:37:27.000+00:00\"},{\"id\":3,\"program_id\":1,\"code\":\"PLO3\",\"description\":\"Communicate effectively in a variety of professional contexts.\",\"description_vn\":null,\"category\":\"ATTITUDE\",\"version_number\":1,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-04T12:37:27.000+00:00\"}],\"course\":[{\"id\":68,\"course_code\":\"IT138IU\",\"name\":\"Data Science and Data Visualization\",\"name_vn\":\"Khoa học Dữ liệu và Trực quan hóa\",\"department_id\":1,\"credit_theory\":3,\"credit_lab\":1,\"course_level\":\"UNDERGRADUATE\",\"description\":null,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-04T12:37:27.000+00:00\"}]}'),(48,3781,3781,1,'v1.0','APPROVED','2026-09-17 22:18:41.663174','dean.scse','{\"syllabus\":{\"id\":3781,\"course_id\":68,\"version_number\":1,\"version_label\":\"v1.0\",\"academic_year\":\"CS2026\",\"status\":\"APPROVED\",\"is_current\":true,\"created_by\":1,\"approved_by\":2,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-17T15:17:05.000+00:00\",\"approved_at\":\"2026-09-17T15:18:42.000+00:00\",\"change_summary\":null,\"notes\":\"{\\\"schemaVersion\\\":1,\\\"internalNotes\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"personResponsible\\\":\\\"Tran Thanh Tung, Dr. for the course\\\",\\\"dateRevised\\\":\\\"2025-06-10\\\",\\\"creditPoints\\\":\\\"4 (ECTS: 6.18)\\\",\\\"lectureCredits\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"laboratoryCredits\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"workloadStudentResponsibility\\\":\\\"Students are expected to spend at least 8 hours per week for self – studying. This time should be made up of reading, working on exercises and problems and group assignment.\\\",\\\"ploCodes\\\":[\\\"PLO1\\\",\\\"PLO2\\\",\\\"PLO3\\\",\\\"PLO4\\\",\\\"PLO5\\\",\\\"PLO6\\\"],\\\"cloPloMatrix\\\":{\\\"CLO1\\\":{\\\"PLO1\\\":\\\"x\\\",\\\"PLO2\\\":\\\"x\\\"},\\\"CLO2\\\":{\\